  {
   "id": "an",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 600,
   "y": 460,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100083,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700581,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An event matching 5 subscriptions produces 5 deliveries rows - and storing the\npayload on each one would multiply storage by the FAN-OUT FACTOR for no benefit,\nsince all 5 are delivering the IDENTICAL bytes. So deliveries references\ningested_events.id instead: one write, N reads, and a single place to look up\n'what did we actually send' for an audit or a dead-letter replay - rather than\ntrusting 5 copies to stay identical.",
   "originalText": "An event matching 5 subscriptions produces 5 deliveries rows - and storing the\npayload on each one would multiply storage by the FAN-OUT FACTOR for no benefit,\nsince all 5 are delivering the IDENTICAL bytes. So deliveries references\ningested_events.id instead: one write, N reads, and a single place to look up\n'what did we actually send' for an audit or a dead-letter replay - rather than\ntrusting 5 copies to stay identical.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
