   "text": "for the dead-letter dashboard's historical queries - the same way payments' ledger entries and the scheduler's job runs both\ntolerate replica lag on reporting paths. A replica lagging a few seconds does not change what already happened, only how\npromptly a dashboard reflects the very latest attempt.",
